    "text": "suncommunitynews.com\nwebsite\nAu Sable Forks\nAu Sable Forks targeted for revitalization\nBy Teah Dowling,\n14 hours agoJAY | Town officials are looking to apply for a New York Main Street (NYMS) grant to help revitalize downtown Au Sable Forks. “We are the northern gateway into the Adirondacks. It’s where the Town of Jay starts; it’s where Essex County starts; and people drive through it to get to Lake Placid,” said Supervisor Matt Stanley. “We’ve got to encourage growth if we want to be able to boost tourism and lower taxes.”",
